Wait — the PagarMP in reserva/[id] is a form POST to /api/pago/mercadopago with form-encoded body — but the route expects JSON (`await req.json()`). I should make the route accept both: if content-type is JSON use json() else formData → redirect directly. Actually simplest: make the route handle form posts by redirecting. But the flujo-reserva uses fetch JSON expecting { init_point }. So the route should support both. I'll handle in route: 

```ts
